MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_001: My heart's still pounding. How will they get\nthrough this?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_002: I bet the two of them will join forces to overcome the\nrival's jealous tricks. What a love triangle!
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_003: Tialla? What a coincidence that we should\nmeet here.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_004: Queen Theodora? What are you doing here?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_005: Like you, I came to listen to the bard's ballad of love.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_006: I didn't think you'd be interested in something\nso...common.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_007: I am as fond of tales as any.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_008: The bedtime stories of my youth were often of the\ngoddess Yu Phas.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_009: Wow, a queen who likes the things that I like.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_010: {SetColor=Gray}When we first met and she knocked Cai out, I\nthought she was so scary.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_011: {SetColor=Gray}But maybe we have more in common than I realized.\nI wonder what she thinks of the song.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_012: Hm? Why all this murmuring?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_013: Um, Your Majesty, I wonder... If you wanted...\nWell, I was thinking...
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_014: Ah, the sun begins its descent. I must hurry back\nto Cai.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_015: What?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_016: I promised that the two of us would train together\nuntil daybreak. I shall see you some other time.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_017: Ahaha... Training all night, just the two of them?\nSince when are they so close?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_018: Are they bonding because they both use spears?\nNo, it must be more than that.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_019: Cai is Yu Phas's grandson. And Theodora is\ngorgeous. Maybe they share an attraction.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_C_020: I need a plan. How am I going to overcome the\nqueen of Saramis?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_001: OK, this is looking good. Just a little longer.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_002: What a pleasant smell. Are you cooking?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_003: Queen Theodora? Are you spying on me?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_004: I simply happened to be walking past.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_005: {SetColor=Gray}I won't lose.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_006: Pardon?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_007: I won't lose. Not this fight.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_008: What "fight"? I don't follow.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_009: I'm not losing Cai to you.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_010: What has Cai to do with this?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_011: I... I bet... I'm sure you two had fun in your all-night\ntraining session!
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_012: Is that what you... Hah hah hah. I begin to grasp\nwhat this is about.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_013: Aww, you even laugh like a queen. What a royal\npain.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_014: You have the "royal" part right, at any rate.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_015: I have been challenged over matters both weighty\nand trivial, but never have I fought over a man.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_016: Hmhmhm. Is this the wisest stratagem?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_017: What are you saying?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_018: If you intend to engage me seriously, the best course\nwould be to catch me unawares.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_019: Recall the song we heard—the suitor's rival had\nsome devious tricks to play.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_020: That is your forte, I believe. Finding weakness in a\nfoe that you can exploit.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_021: I have no intention of using battle tactics on you, if\nthat's what you mean. I won't resort to deception.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_022: Oh?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_023: Your Majesty, you are beyond compare. Next to you,\nI'm just a silly girl. It's overwhelming.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_024: And that's why I have to fight you head on.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_025: Hmm.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_026: Not every plan has to be a trick or a ruse.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_027: Take this dish, for instance. It's a favorite in Ribeira.\nWe call it shash-shaka.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_028: I am unfamiliar with it. Is this to be your weapon\nof choice?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_029: Hmhmhm. Care for a bite?
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_030: Mmm. This is delicious. The sauce's flavor soaks\nthrough into the vegetables.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_031: You have knowledge of Cai's tastes and the skill to\nsatisfy them. Masterfully done.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_032: You're too kind. But the dish is not yet complete.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_033: When I drop in an ornius egg, the tastiness will\nincrease exponentially.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_034: And by the way, it's Cai's favorite. If the way to his\nheart is through his stomach, call me the trailblazer.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_035: Hahaha. Well now. You are a worthy adversary\nindeed, Tialla.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_036: But the queen of Saramis does not back down from\ncombat, no matter what it is fought with.
MID_SE_Seo_Tia_B_037: Let's dance, queenie.